{
  "title": "Control Plane",
  "uid": "nke-benchmarks-control-plane",
  "tags": [
    "nke",
    "nke-benchmarks",
    "control-plane",
    "apiserver",
    "etcd",
    "scheduler"
  ],
  "description": "Control-plane behaviour during a benchmark run: API request latency, pod startup and scheduling, API Priority and Fairness, etcd, and control-plane resource use. Threshold lines mark the SIG-Scalability SLOs, not observed values.",
  "editable": true,
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "timezone": "",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-1h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "refresh": "1m",
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "datasource",
        "type": "datasource",
        "label": "Datasource",
        "query": "prometheus",
        "hide": 0,
        "current": {},
        "refresh": 1
      },
      {
        "name": "cluster",
        "type": "query",
        "label": "Cluster",
        "description": "Values of the k8s_cluster_name label, populated only where the datasource holds several clusters. All (.*) matches every series, including those without the label. A cluster label under any other name is not filtered.",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${datasource}"
        },
        "query": "label_values(up, k8s_cluster_name)",
        "hide": 0,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "multi": true,
        "current": {
          "selected": true,
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        },
        "sort": 1,
        "refresh": 1,
        "definition": "label_values(up, k8s_cluster_name)"
      },
      {
        "name": "quantile",
        "type": "custom",
        "label": "Quantile",
        "query": "p50 : 0.50, p90 : 0.90, p99 : 0.99",
        "hide": 0,
        "current": {
          "text": "p99",
          "value": "0.99"
        },
        "options": [
          {
            "text": "p50",
            "value": "0.50",
            "selected": false
          },
          {
            "text": "p90",
            "value": "0.90",
            "selected": false
          },
          {
            "text": "p99",
            "value": "0.99",
            "selected": true
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 22,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Requirements and scope",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Requirements.** Prometheus scraping the API server, etcd, kube-scheduler, kube-controller-manager and the kubelet under kube-prometheus-stack's job names (`apiserver`, `kube-etcd`, `kube-scheduler`, `kube-controller-manager`, `kubelet`).\n\n**Scope.** Kubernetes 1.34 metric names; use until a newer `dashboards/` directory exists. `$cluster` filters on `k8s_cluster_name` and matches everything when the label is absent, so a single-cluster Prometheus needs no relabeling. Inline PromQL; no recording rules."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "API call latency — SIG-Scalability SLOs",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "Mutating API latency ${quantile:text} (SLO <= 1s)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "thresholdsStyle": {
              "mode": "line"
            }
          },
          "unit": "s",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile($quantile, sum by (verb, resource, le) (rate(apiserver_request_duration_seconds_bucket{k8s_cluster_name=~\"$cluster\", job=\"apiserver\", verb=~\"POST|PUT|DELETE|PATCH\", subresource!~\"log|exec|portforward|attach|proxy\"}[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{verb}} {{resource}}"
        }
      ],
      "description": "POST/PUT/DELETE/PATCH. SLO is 1s at p99."
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "title": "Read-only API latency ${quantile:text}, scope=resource (SLO <= 1s)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 5
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "thresholdsStyle": {
              "mode": "line"
            }
          },
          "unit": "s",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile($quantile, sum by (verb, resource, le) (rate(apiserver_request_duration_seconds_bucket{k8s_cluster_name=~\"$cluster\", job=\"apiserver\", verb=~\"LIST|GET\", subresource!~\"log|exec|portforward|attach|proxy\", scope=\"resource\"}[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{verb}} {{resource}}"
        }
      ],
      "description": "Single-resource reads. SLO is 1s at p99."
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "title": "Read-only API latency ${quantile:text}, scope=namespace|cluster (SLO <= 30s)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 16,
        "y": 5
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "thresholdsStyle": {
              "mode": "line"
            }
          },
          "unit": "s",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 30
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile($quantile, sum by (verb, resource, scope, le) (rate(apiserver_request_duration_seconds_bucket{k8s_cluster_name=~\"$cluster\", job=\"apiserver\", verb=~\"LIST|GET\", subresource!~\"log|exec|portforward|attach|proxy\", scope=~\"namespace|cluster\"}[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{verb}} {{resource}} ({{scope}})"
        }
      ],
      "description": "Namespace- and cluster-scoped LISTs. Separate 30s SLO. The scenario does not split get_p99_ms by scope, so it is judged against the tighter resource-scope bar; this panel is where the looser bar is visible."
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Pod startup and scheduling",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 13
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "title": "Kubelet pod startup SLI ${quantile:text} (SLO <= 5s)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 14
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "thresholdsStyle": {
              "mode": "line"
            }
          },
          "unit": "s",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 5
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile($quantile, sum by (le) (rate(kubelet_pod_start_sli_duration_seconds_bucket{k8s_cluster_name=~\"$cluster\"}[2m])))",
          "legendFormat": "${quantile:text}"
        }
      ],
      "description": "PROXY, not the gated number. The scenario's pod_startup_p99_s comes from ClusterLoader2's own PodStartupLatency measurement, which times create/schedule/run transitions off the pod watch stream. This kubelet-reported histogram is the closest Prometheus equivalent and will not match exactly."
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "title": "Scheduling throughput (threshold >= 15 pods/s)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 14
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "thresholdsStyle": {
              "mode": "line"
            }
          },
          "unit": "reqps",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 15
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "sum(rate(scheduler_schedule_attempts_total{k8s_cluster_name=~\"$cluster\", job=\"kube-scheduler\", result=\"scheduled\"}[2m]))",
          "legendFormat": "scheduled/s"
        }
      ],
      "description": "CL2 gates this in its own scheduler-throughput phase (a separate deployment sized by CL2_SCHEDULER_THROUGHPUT_PODS_PER_DEPLOYMENT), not during the main load phase. A violation is raised when throughput falls BELOW the threshold, so 15 is a floor."
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "title": "Scheduler attempt and algorithm latency ${quantile:text}",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 16,
        "y": 14
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 10
          },
          "unit": "s"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile($quantile, sum by (le) (rate(scheduler_scheduling_attempt_duration_seconds_bucket{k8s_cluster_name=~\"$cluster\", job=\"kube-scheduler\"}[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "attempt ${quantile:text}"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile($quantile, sum by (le) (rate(scheduler_scheduling_algorithm_duration_seconds_bucket{k8s_cluster_name=~\"$cluster\", job=\"kube-scheduler\"}[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "algorithm ${quantile:text}"
        }
      ],
      "description": "No SLO. Context for why throughput moves."
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "API Priority and Fairness",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 22
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "title": "APF rejected requests — expected none",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 23
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 10
          },
          "unit": "reqps"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (priority_level, flow_schema, reason) (rate(apiserver_flowcontrol_rejected_requests_total{k8s_cluster_name=~\"$cluster\", job=\"apiserver\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{priority_level}} / {{flow_schema}} ({{reason}})"
        }
      ],
      "description": "This counter is label-partitioned by flow_schema/priority_level/reason, so it is absent from /metrics until a rejection occurs. An empty panel therefore means no rejections, provided the API server is being scraped (see Control-plane component up). It carries no `or vector(0)` fallback: a synthetic zero would render identically whether the metric was absent or genuinely zero."
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "title": "Inflight requests by kind",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 23
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 10
          },
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (request_kind) (apiserver_current_inflight_requests{k8s_cluster_name=~\"$cluster\", job=\"apiserver\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{request_kind}}"
        }
      ],
      "description": "Summed across API servers, so it reads higher than any one server carries. With API Priority and Fairness enabled (the default), max-requests-inflight and max-mutating-requests-inflight add up to one concurrency limit per API server, not two separate caps; compare that limit with a single server's inflight, not this sum."
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "title": "API request rate by verb",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 16,
        "y": 23
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 10
          },
          "unit": "reqps"
        },
        "overrides": []
